{
  "_readme": [
    "THE DEFAULT RASCH PAPER — edit this file to change what the builder's",
    "\"Namunaviy variant\" (Fill default) button loads. Contract: docs/RASCH_QUIZ.md.",
    "",
    "One entry per question, and the entries must add up to the blueprint EXACTLY:",
    "  numbers-y1 2 | algebraic-y1 11 | equations-y1 6 | functions-y1 2 |",
    "  geometry-y1 7 | analysis-y1 2 | probability-y1 2      (32 closed, Y-1)",
    "  geometry-y2 3                                          (3 closed, Y-2)",
    "  equations-o 2 | functions-o 1 | analysis-o 2 |",
    "  geometry-o 4 | probability-o 1                         (10 typed, O)",
    "= 45. lib/RASCHdefaultPaper.ts checks it and the builder refuses to load a",
    "paper that does not balance, naming the row that is off — it never ships a",
    "silently wrong variant.",
    "",
    "Per entry:",
    "  sectionId   a blueprint row id from lib/Examblueprint.ts (the list above).",
    "  chapterId   a chapter that row DRAWS FROM ('01'..'18' Algebra, '01'..'11'",
    "              Geometriya) — the topicId is derived from the row's pools, so a",
    "              chapter the row does not draw from is rejected.",
    "  question    a string, or {uz, ru, en}. A bare string is used for all three.",
    "  options     A-D, closed rows ONLY. An O row must NOT have them.",
    "  answer      Y-1/Y-2 -> the correct option key ('A'..'D').",
    "              O       -> the literal answer text the student types.",
    "  acceptedAnswers  O only, optional: other spellings graded correct.",
    "  numeric     O only, default true — grades with the numeric comparison",
    "              (',' = '.', spaces ignored). Set false for a worded answer.",
    "  explanation optional, string or {uz, ru, en}.",
    "  difficultyId optional; defaults to the row's band (Y-1 -> 2, Y-2/O -> 3).",
    "",
    "Images are not supported here on purpose: a picture belongs to a real",
    "teacher_questions document with a storage URL, not to a bundled JSON file."
  ],

